{"logId": "198da684-6360-4e4f-9fb1-4aa515b6c5c0", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 2800, "height": 2000, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、新录用人员报到应先到人力资源部办理下列手续：", "block_bbox": [173, 120, 1146, 168], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[173.0, 120.0], [1146.0, 120.0], [1146.0, 168.0], [173.0, 168.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "如实填写相关人事资料表格：", "block_bbox": [237, 184, 814, 232], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[237.0, 184.0], [814.0, 184.0], [814.0, 232.0], [237.0, 232.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "☑递交体检合格证明书原件：", "block_bbox": [237, 247, 773, 296], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[237.0, 247.0], [773.0, 247.0], [773.0, 296.0], [237.0, 296.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "核对并递交学历证书原件；", "block_bbox": [237, 311, 773, 359], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[237.0, 311.0], [773.0, 311.0], [773.0, 359.0], [237.0, 359.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "☑核对并递交身份证原件、当地政府规定的各类就业证件原件，各项社会保障的转移手续；", "block_bbox": [236, 375, 1897, 425], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[236.0, 375.0], [1897.0, 375.0], [1897.0, 425.0], [236.0, 425.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "交一寸的半身照片3张；", "block_bbox": [238, 440, 706, 488], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 440.0], [706.0, 440.0], [706.0, 488.0], [238.0, 488.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "需要办理的其他手续：", "block_bbox": [240, 505, 689, 551], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[240.0, 505.0], [689.0, 505.0], [689.0, 551.0], [240.0, 551.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、新录用员工报到后，公司凭其提供的合法用工证明与其签署劳动合同书。在试用期满之前，4条款所规定手续仍无法齐备的，将被视为不符合录用条件，依照政府相关规定，公司与其解除劳动关系，并不支付经济赔偿。", "block_bbox": [175, 568, 2603, 681], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[175.0, 568.0], [2603.0, 568.0], [2603.0, 681.0], [175.0, 681.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、所有员工个人情况如住址、婚姻状况、生育状况等发生变化时，应于七日内通知人力资源部。", "block_bbox": [173, 696, 1942, 745], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[173.0, 696.0], [1942.0, 696.0], [1942.0, 745.0], [173.0, 745.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "四、录用禁忌", "block_bbox": [90, 760, 353, 808], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[90.0, 760.0], [353.0, 760.0], [353.0, 808.0], [90.0, 808.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、公司是员工唯一的工作场所。", "block_bbox": [174, 824, 772, 872], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[174.0, 824.0], [772.0, 824.0], [772.0, 872.0], [174.0, 872.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "员工在为公司服务期间不得在其他任何公司或机构从事兼职或专职工作；未经批准，员工不得为其他任何公司或机构从事商业活动，即使是无偿的。", "block_bbox": [228, 888, 2582, 1001], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[228.0, 888.0], [2582.0, 888.0], [2582.0, 1001.0], [228.0, 1001.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "第五章 工时", "block_bbox": [1179, 1102, 1516, 1157], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[1179.0, 1102.0], [1516.0, 1102.0], [1516.0, 1157.0], [1179.0, 1157.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "每月工时不超过196小时。", "block_bbox": [169, 1209, 638, 1258], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[169.0, 1209.0], [638.0, 1209.0], [638.0, 1258.0], [169.0, 1258.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "第六章 考 勤", "block_bbox": [1179, 1377, 1514, 1432], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[1179.0, 1377.0], [1514.0, 1377.0], [1514.0, 1432.0], [1179.0, 1432.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考勤制度", "block_bbox": [89, 1465, 270, 1512], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[89.0, 1465.0], [270.0, 1465.0], [270.0, 1512.0], [89.0, 1512.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、员工应准时上班，不得迟到、早退、旷职：", "block_bbox": [174, 1530, 1025, 1578], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[174.0, 1530.0], [1025.0, 1530.0], [1025.0, 1578.0], [174.0, 1578.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、月内迟到、早退合计三次，以旷工一天计算；", "block_bbox": [174, 1594, 1067, 1642], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[174.0, 1594.0], [1067.0, 1594.0], [1067.0, 1642.0], [174.0, 1642.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、未请假或假满未经续假而擅自不到职，根据实际缺勤天数按旷工处理；", "block_bbox": [173, 1658, 1523, 1706], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[173.0, 1658.0], [1523.0, 1658.0], [1523.0, 1706.0], [173.0, 1706.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、离职期间，工资不发。", "block_bbox": [175, 1722, 650, 1771], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[175.0, 1722.0], [650.0, 1722.0], [650.0, 1771.0], [175.0, 1771.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "19", "block_bbox": [2669, 1912, 2720, 1944], "block_id": 20, "block_order": null, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[2669.0, 1912.0], [2719.0, 1912.0], [2719.0, 1943.0], [2669.0, 1943.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8341777920722961, "coordinate": [173, 120, 1146, 168], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[173.0, 